        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_3090.svg",
        "text": "Global IPL Device Sales",
        "text1": "No. 1",
        "des": "Source: Frost & Sullivan (Beijing) Consulting Co., Ltd. Shanghai Branch, based on independent research on the global hair removal device market; based on the global sales volume of hair removal devices from 2022 to 2024; hair removal devices refer to beauty devices that act on hair follicles through technologies such as lasers and intense pulsed light, aiming to reduce or remove hair; this survey was completed in February 2025.",
